"""Check-only R3 controller. Requires bound approval receipts and a derived candidate inventory.

This controller runs only the unmodified committed rust-inventory.py --check against a derived candidate inventory. The input is NOT represented as generated/current; only the later --check can establish currentness. It does not generate, build, test, or publish. It creates one isolated worktree at the exact reviewed commit, seeds the candidate, checks it once, retains output/logs, verifies shared node_modules, and removes only its own worktree. Total wall-clock budget is 600 seconds including cleanup.
"""
